Snapshot: packages/{cli,codegen,core,hermes} and
modules/{fs,gesture-handler,reanimated,safe-area-context,screens,svg,worklets}.
Examples, tester, testing package, website, and unused fonts/vector-icons ports
are not included. Upstream tests and build sources within retained packages stay
with the snapshot so contributors can inspect and modify the renderer.

Local patches (all other retained files match the revision above):
- packages/core/ReactGpui/rn-gpui/src/node_view.rs: box-none views must not
  install their own pointer area. Otherwise an empty portal overlay redirects
  clicks to its parent, blocking Paseo's sidebar. native.test.ts exercises this
  against the actual app.
- packages/core/src-gpui/Libraries/Components/StatusBar/StatusBar.desktop.js:
  desktop StatusBar implementation, because there is no mobile OS status bar.

GPUI itself remains a pinned Cargo git dependency. Hermes/React Native prebuilt
libraries are downloaded by upstream build tooling; this is not an offline or
fully source-built distribution.
